{"id":"n65218-1-9","stage":1,"title":"스파게티 · 意大利面","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n65218-1-9-1","ko":"오랜만에 레스토랑에 가서 외식을 할까?","zh":"好久没去餐厅吃饭了，咱们去吃个饭吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오랜만에","meaning":"好久，久违","explanation":"오랜만：好久，久违；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"오랜만","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68090","senseId":"1","lemma":"오랜만","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"레스토랑에","meaning":"西餐厅","explanation":"레스토랑：西餐厅；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"레스토랑","audio":"/audio/98acfd757481a16c4522.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52573","senseId":"1","lemma":"레스토랑","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가서","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외식을","meaning":"在外用餐，外餐","explanation":"외식：在外用餐，外餐；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"외식","audio":"/audio/1bbd94acaee739271f6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69119","senseId":"1","lemma":"외식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"할까?","meaning":"表示想法或推测。","explanation":"하다：表示想法或推测。；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"27","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2208566c28753d00","term":"오랜만","zh":"好久，久违","audio":"/audio/2208566c28753d001fd8.mp3","entryId":"68090","definition":"从有某事开始过了很长时间后。","pronunciation":["오랜만"]},{"id":"98acfd757481a16c","term":"레스토랑","zh":"西餐厅","audio":"/audio/98acfd757481a16c4522.mp3","entryId":"52573","definition":"出售西餐的餐馆。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"1bbd94acaee73927","term":"외식","zh":"在外用餐，外餐","audio":"/audio/1bbd94acaee739271f6e.mp3","entryId":"69119","definition":"在家外面就餐；或指那样的就餐。","pronunciation":["외ː식","웨ː식"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"表示想法或推测。","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"表示想法或推测。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/648963d31338d48c8d1b.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n65218-1-9-2","ko":"그래. 그럼 스파게티랑 스테이크를 시켜 먹자.","zh":"好啊。那我们就点意大利面和牛排一起吃吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스파게티랑","meaning":"意大利面","explanation":"스파게티：意大利面；랑：连接并列名词，表示“和”。","readings":[{"term":"스파게티","audio":"/audio/5903c57adc34785ffc53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65218","senseId":"1","lemma":"스파게티","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"스테이크를","meaning":"牛排","explanation":"스테이크：牛排；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"스테이크","audio":"/audio/ab7683aa464d2bb930e6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65077","senseId":"1","lemma":"스테이크","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"시켜","meaning":"点，叫","explanation":"시키다：点，叫；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"시키다","audio":"/audio/0258d8fe6108bb9cba15.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29769","senseId":"2","lemma":"시키다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹자.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","t